lute was suggested by our member Colin Marsh, who writes: 'Alan J Pakula’s memorably atmospheric 1971 thriller starring Donald Sutherland and a stunning Best Actress Oscar performance from the wonderful Jane Fonda in the unforgettable role of Bree Daniels..' With her Oscar-winning turn&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/klute/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 31 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5731154.TcsSection_638\">15:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-l\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/lamour-braque/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5887635.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/lamour-braque/\">L'Amour braque <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Andrzej Żuławski, France, 1985</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Screenings of L'Amour braque will feature a video introduction from writer and film historian, Samm Deighan. Intended as a homage to Fyodor Dostoyevsky and loosely based on his novel The Idiot, Żuławski’s L’Amour braque is the story of a bloody vendetta, of bonds&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/lamour-braque/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 03 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888711.TcsSection_638\">20:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 22 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888914.TcsSection_971\">20:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/la-femme-publique/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5887539.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/la-femme-publique/\">La femme publique <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Andrzej Żuławski, France, 1984</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on August 23rd will be introduced by writer Daniel Bird. The screening on October 1st will be introduced by filmmaker Craig Williams. An inexperienced young actress is invited to play a role in a film based on Dostoyevsky's The Possessed.&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/la-femme-publique/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 10 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888761.TcsSection_638\">15:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 01 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888992.TcsSection_638\">20:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </d