toria Rose, Luca Salice (PSC Westminster). It will be hosted by the UK Director of Human Rights Watch, Yasmine Ahmed.   'Compulsory viewing' - Ken Loach&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/life-support/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 14 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  q_and_a \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6034659.TcsSection_971\">20:20</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-q_and_a\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-m\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/mares-nest-qa/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/6099018.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/mares-nest-qa/\">Mare's Nest + Q&amp;A <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Ben Rivers, 2025, UK, France, Canada</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                This screening will be followed by a Q&A with filmmaker and artist Ben Rivers. Moon travels through a mysterious world free of adults. She meets a sage, and her translator, in a mountain hut, where she tries to understand what is happening.&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/mares-nest-qa/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 13 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  q_and_a \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6023459.TcsSection_3060731\">19:15</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-q_and_a\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/marketa-lazarova/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5945647.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/marketa-lazarova/\">Marketa Lazarová <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Frantisek Vlácil, 1967, Czechoslovakia</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Our screening on Friday 9 October will be introduced by Czech film expert Peter Hames. Voted the best Czech film ever made, Marketa Lazarová is a powerful and passionate medieval epic set in the mid-13th Century. Based on avant-garde writer Vladislav Vancura's novel,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/marketa-lazarova/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 20 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5955597.TcsSection_638\">13:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 28 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5955880.TcsSection_638\">14:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 09 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5956094.TcsSection_638\">20:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/matilda/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/861845.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/matilda/\">Matilda (30th Anniversary) <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Danny DeVito, 1996, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Based on the beloved book from Roald Dahl, this film adaptation directed by Danny DeVito tells the story of Matilda, a gifted young girl who shares a home with parents who ignore her and a brother who mistreats her. Upon starting school,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/matilda/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 21 Nov</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6041454.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 22 Nov</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span clas