creening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5956450.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 08 Nov</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6019815.TcsSection_638\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/monsieur-hulots-holiday/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/964651.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/monsieur-hulots-holiday/\">Monsieur Hulot's Holiday <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Jacques Tati, 1953, France</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Summer holidays at The Garden Cinema would not be complete without Monsieur Hulot. Jacques Tati’s endearing clown, takes a holiday at a seaside resort, where his presence provokes one catastrophe after another. Tati’s masterpiece of gentle slapstick is a series of effortlessly&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/monsieur-hulots-holiday/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 25 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  closed  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5607504.TcsSection_971\">13:40</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-closed\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/my-neighbour-totoro/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/6035705.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/my-neighbour-totoro/\">My Neighbour Totoro [Dubbed] <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Hayao Miyazaki, Japan, 1988</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                From the legendary Studio Ghibli, creators of Spirited Away and Ponyo, and Academy Award-winning director Hayao Miyazaki, comes a classic tale of magic and adventure for the whole family. When Satsuki and her sister Mei move with their father to a new home&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/my-neighbour-totoro/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 17 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6035779.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 18 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6035790.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-n\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/nostalgia-2/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5734975.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/nostalgia-2/\">Nostalghia <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12A</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Andrei Tarkovsky, 1983, Soviet Union, Italy</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                New digital restoration. A Russian poet, Andrei, conducts research in Italy on a composer from his homeland. There, he meets old Domenico, a man many consider insane. Domenico entrusts him with a highly original mission: to cross the Bagno Vignoni thermal bath&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/nostalgia-2/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 27 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6059603.TcsSection_3060731\">13:15</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-o\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/on-the-silver-globe/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5887780.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/on-the-silver-globe/\">On the Silver Globe <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Andrzej Żuławski, Poland, 1988</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on August 22nd will feature an introduction by writer Daniel Bird. Subsequent screenings of On the Silver Globe will feature a video introduction by writer Adam Żuławski. A small group of cosmic explorers, including a woman, leaves Earth to find freedom&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/on-the-silver-globe/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 21 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888908.TcsSection_638\">14:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 03 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5889046.TcsSection_638\">19:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-p\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/paprika-20th-anniversary/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5839566.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/paprika-20th-anniversary/\">Paprika - 20th anniversary <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Satoshi Kon, 2006, Japan</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Satoshi's Kon's visionary and mind-melting anime Paprika returns for its 20th anniversary. Prepare to enter the realm of fantasy and imagination - where reality and dreams collide in a kaleidoscopic mindscape of sheer visual genius. The film centres on a revolutionary machine that&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/paprika-20th-anniversary/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 25 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  closed \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6059590.TcsSection_971\">15:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-closed\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 26 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6059680.TcsSection_3060731\">18:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/persepolis/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5849949.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/persepolis/\">Persepolis <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Marjane Satrapi, Vincent Paronnaud, 2007, France, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Persepolis was suggested by our member Sarah Halim, who writes: ‘I’m proposing that we screen Persepolis as a tribute to the wonderfully talented Marjane Satrapi, following her recent untimely death of a broken heart'. In 1970s Iran, Marjane ‘Marji’ Satrapi watches events through her&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/persepolis/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 03 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5849962.TcsSection_638\">15:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/possession/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5887502.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/possession/\">Possession <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Andrzej Żuławski, France, West Germany, 1981</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The film will be introduced by writer and historian Susan Jonusas on the 18th of September and by writer Stephen Thrower on the 10th of October. After returning home to West Berlin, international spy Mark is blindsided when his wife, Anna, abruptly&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/possession/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 18 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888883.TcsSection_638\">20:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 10 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5889107.TcsSection_638\">17:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-r\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/reclaim-the-frame-presents-beautiful-thing/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/6059654.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/reclaim-the-frame-presents-beautiful-thing/\">Reclaim The Frame Presents: Beautiful Thing <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Hettie Macdonald, 1996,  UK</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Join Fruits on Film and Reclaim The Frame for a special 30th anniversary screening of Beautiful Thing. This screening will have Descriptive subtitles (DS). A tender story of first love, belonging and growing up, Beautiful Thing follows neighbours Jamie and Ste as their friendship deepens&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/reclaim-the-frame-presents-beautiful-thing/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 09 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5981651.TcsSection_3060731\">20:20</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/red-rose-white-rose-qa/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5710598.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/red-rose-white-rose-qa/\">Red Rose White Rose <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Stanley Kwan, 1994, Hong Kong</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                *Please note that whilst tickets for the Q&A screening of Red Rose White Rose are currently sold out, Stanley Kwan will attend an in-person masterclass on 26 August and free registration is available here. The screening on 27 August will be followed by&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/red-rose-white-rose-qa/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 27 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  q_and_a sold-out \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5734539.TcsSection_3060731\">19:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-q_and_a\"></span><div class=\"screening-panel__footer-row\"><h4 class=\"\" data-name=\"Red Rose White Rose\" data-datetime=\"Thu 27 Aug 19:00\" data-id=\"25863\"><span style=\"color:#C00;  margin-right: 3px;\" >SOLD OUT</span>&ndash; <a href=\"/login\" title=\"Members – login to add yourself to the waiting list\">Members: login to join waiting list</a></h4></div></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/reverie-cineclub-presents-80-years-of-defa-animated-short-films-for-the-family/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5697491.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/reverie-cineclub-presents-80-years-of-defa-animated-short-films-for-the-family/\">Reverie Cineclub presents 80 Years of DEFA: Animated Short Films for the Family <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Various Directors, East Germany, Various Years</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Reverie Cineclub is delighted to present a special selection of six animated shorts from the DEFA Studio for Animation Film in Dresden, Germany, in celebration of its 80th anniversary this year. Founded in 1946, DEFA became East Germany’s state film studio, while&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/reverie-cineclub-presents-80-years-of-defa-animated-short-films-for-the-family/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 12 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5697515.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 13 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5697520.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/rio/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5672652.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/rio/\">Rio <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Carlos Saldanha, 2011, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                This comedy-adventure centers on Blu, a flightless rare macaw who acts more human than bird. His world is turned upside down when he discovers he must travel all the way to Rio to save his species. There, he meets the wildly independent&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/rio/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 05 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/T