 audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6097982.TcsSection_971\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 03 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5943714.TcsSection_638\">18:05</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/that-most-important-thing-love/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5887364.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/that-most-important-thing-love/\">That Most Important Thing: Love <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">18</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Andrzej Żuławski, France, 1975</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on the September 1st will be introduced by Garden Cinema team member, writer, and filmmaker Sarah Grice. Subsequent screenings will include a video introduction by writer and film historian, Samm Deighan. Servais, a photographer burdened with debt, crosses paths with&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/that-most-important-thing-love/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 01 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888691.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 16 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888877.TcsSection_638\">14:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 13 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5889119.TcsSection_971\">20:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-cassandra-cat/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5945274.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-cassandra-cat/\">The Cassandra Cat <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Vojtěch Jasný, 1963, Czechoslovakia</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Vojtěch Jasný's sumptuous, surreal satire is one of the most visually inventive and uninhibited films of the Czechoslovak New Wave. A travelling circus and its magical feline mascot arrive in a provincial Czech town, unleashing mayhem as they expose the virtues, vices&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-cassandra-cat/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 13 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5955537.TcsSection_638\">14:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-cremator/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5945240.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-cremator/\">The Cremator <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Juraj Herz, 1969, Czechoslovakia </em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                All screenings feature a recorded introduction from curator and scholar of Eastern European cult cinema Daniel Bird. Juraj Herz's film The Cremator has been described in many ways - as surrealist-inspired horror, as expressionist fantasy, as a dark and disturbing tale of terror.&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-cremator/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 02 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5955987.TcsSection_638\">20:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 19 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5956180.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-devil/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5887245.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-devil/\">The Devil <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Andrzej Żuławski, Poland, 1972</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on the 26th of August will be introduced by writer Michael Brooke. The screenings on September the 11th and 27th will feature a video introduction by Andrzej Jaroszewicz, camera operator on The Devil and frequent collaborator of Andrzej Żuławski. During the&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-devil/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 26 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888573.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 11 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888791.TcsSection_638\">20:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 27 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888980.TcsSection_638\">16:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-ear/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5945171.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-ear/\">The Ear <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">12</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Karel Kachyňa, 1970, Czechoslovakia</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Our screening on Tuesday 6 October will be introduced Daniela Richterová, Senior Lecturer in Intelligence Studies at the Department of War Studies, King’s College London. A high-ranking Communist official and his wife begin to suspect that their home has been put under&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-ear/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 06 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5955993.TcsSection_638\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 22 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5956192.TcsSection_638\">14:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-firemens-ball/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5945355.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-firemens-ball/\">The Firemen's Ball <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Milos Forman, 1967, Czechoslovakia</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Our screening on Saturday 10 October will be introduced by Czech film expert Peter Hames and followed by a discussion group in The Atrium Bar. A milestone of the Czechoslovak New Wave, Miloš Forman’s first colour film The Firemen’s Ball is both a&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-firemens-ball/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 24 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5955843.TcsSection_638\">20:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 10 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro  discussion \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5956103.TcsSection_3060731\">16:15</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-discussion\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 17 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5956174.TcsSection_638\">15:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-invite/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5730014.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-invite/\">The Invite <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Olivia Wilde, 2026, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Joe and Angela's marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down? The Garden Cinema&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-invite/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 25 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6059594.TcsSection_971\">20:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 27 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6059863.TcsSection_638\">13:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 29 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6097918.TcsSection_3060731\">20:25</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 01 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5995788.TcsSection_3060731\">20:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-london-international-animation-festival-presents-8-astonishing-animated-shorts-for-4-12-year-o/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5736269.png\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-london-international-animation-festival-presents-8-astonishing-animated-shorts-for-4-12-year-o/\">The London International Animation Festival presents 8  Astonishing Animated Shorts for ages 4+ <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Various Directors, Various Years, Various Countries</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Like childhood, animation is full of wonder and simple pleasures. This carefully chosen programme for our littlest and most special audience contains 8 of the best, wonderful short animated films, full of joy, from all around the world. There’ll be talking animals,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-london-international-animation-festival-presents-8-astonishing-animated-shorts-for-4-12-year-o/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 29 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5736826.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 30 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5736828.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 31 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5736830.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/pirates-in-an-adventure-with-scientists/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5980588.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/pirates-in-an-adventure-with-scientists/\">The Pirates! In an Adventure with Scientists! <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Peter Lord, Jeff Newitt, 2012, UK, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Another gem from Aardman Productions, adapted by Gideon Defoe from his children's book. The Pirates! In an Adventure with Scientists! follows a crew of hapless pirates in their attempt to win the much coveted Pirate of the Year Award. Hugh Grant stars in his&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/pirates-in-an-adventure-with-scientists/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 14 Nov</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5982293.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 15 Nov</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5982301.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-princess-and-the-frog/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/6034827.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-princess-and-the-frog/\">The Princess and the Frog <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">U</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>John Musker, Ron Clements, 2009, USA</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                In New Orleans during the Jazz Age, a beautiful girl named Tiana (Anika Noni Rose) dreams of owning her own restaurant. When she meets a frog prince who desperately wants to be human again, a fateful kiss leads them both on a&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-princess-and-the-frog/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 03 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6035532.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 04 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  pay_what_you_can \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6035552.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-pay_what_you_can\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-shop-on-the-high-street/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5945142.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-shop-on-the-high-street/\">The Shop on the High Street <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Ján Kadár and Elmar Klos, 1965, Czechoslovakia</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Our screening on Monday 7 September will be introduced by writer, editor, and multimedia producer Michael Brooke. Winner of the Oscar for Best Foreign Language Feature in 1965, Ján Kadár and Elmar Klos’ The Shop on the High Street is one of the&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-shop-on-the-high-street/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 07 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5955511.TcsSection_638\">17:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 15 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5955591.TcsSection_638\">15:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-summer-book/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5869958.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-summer-book/\">The Summer Book <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Charlie McDowell, 2024, Finland, UK, USA </em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The Summer Book follows an intergenerational family spending a transformative summer at their rustic vacation home on an unspoiled, remote island in the Gulf of Finland. Adapted from Tove Jansson’s beloved novel, the film explores grief, nature, and the delicate bonds between a&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-summer-book/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 25 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6059592.TcsSection_971\">18:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 26 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6059597.TcsSection_971\">15:15</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 27 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  baby_screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6025285.TcsSection_3060731\">11:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-baby_screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 31 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6097951.TcsSection_971\">13:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 03 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6097888.TcsSection_638\">13:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-third-part-of-the-night/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5887185.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-third-part-of-the-night/\">The Third Part of the Night <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Andrzej Żuławski, Poland, 1971</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                The screening on the 12th of October will feature an introduction by writer Michael Brooke. The first feature by Andrzej Żuławski immediately established his emotionally charged, fast-and-furious style. Drawing from the biography of his father, particularly his experiences in Nazi German-occupied Poland,&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-third-part-of-the-night/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 30 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888685.TcsSection_638\">14:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 06 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5888749.TcsSection_638\">19:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 12 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5889113.TcsSection_638\">20:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-valley-of-the-bees/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5944858.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-valley-of-the-bees/\">The Valley of the Bees <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>František Vláčil, 1967, Czechoslovakia</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                Our screening on Sunday 11 October will be introduced by writer, lecturer, and Czech cinema expert, Peter Hames. Set in a vividly recreated 13th-century Europe, František Vláčil’s visionary medieval epic chronicles the tale of a young boy forced to join the Order&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-valley-of-the-bees/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 30 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5955886.TcsSection_638\">17:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 11 Oct</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5956113.TcsSection_638\">13:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" >\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/tony/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5900786.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/tony/\">Tony <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">15</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Matt Johnson, 2026, USA, Canada</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                A 19-year-old Anthony Bourdain travels to Provincetown and stumbles into the chaotic world of a restaurant kitchen, setting off a summer that will shape the course of his life. The Garden Cinema View: Hot on the heels of Nirvanna the Band the&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/tony/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 25 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  closed  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5900963.TcsSection_3060731\">16:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-closed\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5900965.TcsSection_3060731\">18:15</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 26 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5900977.TcsSection_3060731\">16:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5900981.TcsSection_3060731\">20:40</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Thu 27 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  hoh  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5901026.TcsSection_971\">16:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-hoh\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5900993.TcsSection_638\">17:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Fri 28 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6097910.TcsSection_638\">20:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 29 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6097916.TcsSection_3060731\">13:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sun 30 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6097920.TcsSection_971\">16:10</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Mon 31 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6097947.TcsSection_3060731\">13:45</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Tue 01 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6097969.TcsSection_3060731\">17:30</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Wed 02 Sep</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  audio_description \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_6097980.TcsSection_638\">20:10</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-audio_description\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film\" style=\"background-image: url();\" id=\"starts-with-w\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-image\">\n                          <a\n              href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/western-approaches/\"><img class=\"films-list__by-title__film-thumb\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5882754.jpg\" /></a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-title__film-content\">\n            <h2\n              class=\"films-list__by-title__film-title\"><a  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/western-approaches/\">Western Approaches <span class=\"film-detail__film__rating\">PG</span></a></h2>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__az-summary\">\n              <em>Pat Jackson, 1944, UK</em></div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__synopsis\">\n                                This edition of Composing Cinema examines the work of Clifton Parker, and his score for one of finest achievements of the Crown Film Unit, Western Approaches. The screening will be introduced by Oscar-nominated composer Gary Yershon. Regarded as one of the best&hellip; <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/western-approaches/\">Read&nbsp;More</a>            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-title__screenings\">\n                  <div class=\"screening-panel__day\"><div class=\"screening-panel__date-title\">Sat 29 Aug</div><div class=\"screening-panel__list\"><div class=\"screening-panel   screening  intro \"><span class=\"screening-time\"><a class=\"screening \" href=\"https://bookings.thegardencinema.co.uk/TheGardenCinema.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_0.TcsWebTab_0.TcsPerformance_5882784.TcsSection_971\">16:00</a></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-screening\"></span><span class=\"screening-tag ext-intro\"></span></div></div></div>              </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n        </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"films-list__by-season films-list-block\">\n  <div class=\"films-list__by-season__inner\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-season__row\">\n                  <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season\">\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/hong-kong-golden-age-1985-1997/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"208\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cuout-hong-kong2026-new-300x208.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cuout-hong-kong2026-new-300x208.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cuout-hong-kong2026-new-368x256.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cuout-hong-kong2026-new-768x533.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cuout-hong-kong2026-new-1024x711.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cuout-hong-kong2026-new-1536x1067.jpg 1536w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cuout-hong-kong2026-new.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/hong-kong-golden-age-1985-1997/\">Hong Kong Golden Age 1985-1997</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\">\n\n                    Thu 09 Jul  &#8212;  Thu 27 Aug 2026\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Following last year’s Hong Kong New Wave 1979–1989 season, The Garden Cinema broadens its focus to the wider Golden Age of Hong Kong cinema, a remarkable era spanning the late 1970s through to the 1990s&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/hong-kong-golden-age-1985-1997/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                  <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season\">\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/members-summer-selection-2026/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cut-out-summer2026-wave1-300x225.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cut-out-summer2026-wave1-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cut-out-summer2026-wave1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cut-out-summer2026-wave1-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cut-out-summer2026-wave1-368x276.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cut-out-summer2026-wave1.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/members-summer-selection-2026/\">Members' Summer Selection 2026</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\">\n\n                    Sat 18 Jul  &#8212;  Mon 31 Aug 2026\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Inspired by your many suggestions on the Members’ Area and passionate campaigning for your favourite films, our Members’ Summer Selection returns once again. We’ve taken into account support and upvotes from the community, as well as&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/members-summer-selection-2026/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                  <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season\">\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/devils-and-shamans-the-films-of-andrzej-zulawski/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ZULAWSKI-6-300x225.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ZULAWSKI-6-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ZULAWSKI-6-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ZULAWSKI-6-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ZULAWSKI-6-368x276.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/ZULAWSKI-6.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/devils-and-shamans-the-films-of-andrzej-zulawski/\">Devils and Shamans: The Films of Andrzej Żuławski</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\">\n\n                    Fri 21 Aug  &#8212;  Wed 21 Oct 2026\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">From August until October, The Garden Cinema presents Devils and Shamans: The Films of Andrzej Żuławski, the most comprehensive retrospective of the Polish filmmaker’s work to ever take place in the UK. Among the&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/devils-and-shamans-the-films-of-andrzej-zulawski/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                  <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season\">\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/czechoslovak-new-wave/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/czech-cut-out-01-300x225.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/czech-cut-out-01-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/czech-cut-out-01-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/czech-cut-out-01-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/czech-cut-out-01-368x276.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/czech-cut-out-01.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/czechoslovak-new-wave/\">Czechoslovak New Wave</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\">\n\n                    Sat 05 Sep  &#8212;  Thu 22 Oct 2026\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Throughout September and October, in collaboration with the Czech Centre London and as part of the 30th Made in Prague Festival, we present masterpieces from the Czechoslovak New Wave. Of all the cinematic movements that&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/season/czechoslovak-new-wave/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n            </div>\n\n    <p class=\"season-detail__more-seasons-link\"><a href=\"/#by-season\">Current Seasons</a> | <a\n        href=\"/about-us/archive-seasons/\">Past Seasons</a></p>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"films-list__by-strand films-list-block\">\n  <div class=\"films-list__by-season__inner\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-season__row\">\n\n                           <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-0\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/films-for-the-family/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"208\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/bambi-cut-out-colour-300x208.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/bambi-cut-out-colour-300x208.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/bambi-cut-out-colour-768x533.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/bambi-cut-out-colour-1024x711.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/bambi-cut-out-colour-368x256.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/bambi-cut-out-colour.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/films-for-the-family/\">Films for the Family</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Sun 24 Jul  &#8212;  Sun 01 Jan 2040\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Join us every Saturday & Sunday morning and on weekdays during the school holidays for some of our favourite family classics. For cinema lovers of all ages. On Sundays the films are followed&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/films-for-the-family/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                                   <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-0\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/members-events/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"182\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/cut-out-members3-300x182.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/cut-out-members3-300x182.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/cut-out-members3-368x223.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/cut-out-members3-768x466.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/cut-out-members3-1024x621.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/cut-out-members3-1536x932.jpg 1536w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/cut-out-members3-2048x1242.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/members-events/\">Members' Events</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Fri 25 Mar  &#8212;  Tue 08 May 2040\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Events for members only, including free fortnightly screenings for Garden Cinema Members with films chosen for members, by members. Selected films are added regularly, so keep an eye on this page for updates.&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/members-events/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                                   <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-0\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/greek-salad/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/stella-3-1-300x225.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/stella-3-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/stella-3-1-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/stella-3-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/stella-3-1-368x276.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/stella-3-1.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/greek-salad/\">Greek Salad</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Thu 19 Mar  &#8212;  Fri 09 Feb 2052\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Greek Salad is an ongoing Greek cinema strand. Each screening explores a gem of Greek cinema – tossing together classics, festival favourites, and directors’ spotlights alike. After concluding our mini retrospective on maverick&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/greek-salad/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                                   <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-0\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/fruits-on-film/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/totally-fucked-up-cutout-2-300x225.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/totally-fucked-up-cutout-2-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/totally-fucked-up-cutout-2-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/totally-fucked-up-cutout-2-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/totally-fucked-up-cutout-2-368x276.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/totally-fucked-up-cutout-2.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/fruits-on-film/\">Fruits on Film</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Sat 15 Aug  &#8212;  Sun 31 Jul 2050\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Fruits on Film is The Garden Cinema’s carefully picked and ongoing queer cinema strand spotlighting LGBTQ+ filmmaking of the past, present, and future. Fruits on Film values screening titles that highlight a wide spectrum of&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/fruits-on-film/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                                   <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-0\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/planting-seeds/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"182\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/thumbnail_planting-seeds-cut-out-300x182.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/thumbnail_planting-seeds-cut-out-300x182.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/thumbnail_planting-seeds-cut-out-368x223.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/thumbnail_planting-seeds-cut-out-768x466.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/thumbnail_planting-seeds-cut-out-1024x621.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/thumbnail_planting-seeds-cut-out-1536x932.jpg 1536w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/thumbnail_planting-seeds-cut-out.jpg 1800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/planting-seeds/\">Planting Seeds</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Sat 05 Apr  &#8212;  Mon 31 Dec 2040\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">The Garden Cinema’s strand for nature and environment-focused screenings. We have curated a selection of international films that span many genres, themes and countries to tell stories of resilience and resistance through the&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/planting-seeds/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                                   <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-0\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/composing-cinema/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"182\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/composing-cinema-cutout-300x182.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/composing-cinema-cutout-300x182.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/composing-cinema-cutout-368x223.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/composing-cinema-cutout-768x466.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/composing-cinema-cutout-1024x621.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/composing-cinema-cutout-1536x932.jpg 1536w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/composing-cinema-cutout-2048x1242.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/composing-cinema/\">Composing Cinema</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Mon 27 Oct  &#8212;  Mon 31 Dec 2040\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Composing Cinema celebrates the bespoke musical contributions made by composers to the world of film and includes guest introductions, Q&As, and live scores.&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/composing-cinema/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                                   <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-0\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/chinese-cinema-project/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Page-Icon-300x169.png\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Page-Icon-300x169.png 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Page-Icon-368x207.png 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Page-Icon-768x432.png 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Page-Icon-1024x576.png 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Page-Icon.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/chinese-cinema-project/\">Chinese Cinema Project</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Sat 19 Nov  &#8212;  Sun 01 Jan 2040\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">The Chinese Cinema Project is an exhibition initiative presented by The Garden Cinema. It showcases works from emerging and under-represented Chinese filmmakers via regular screenings, exploring auteurship and cinematic beauty in its various&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/chinese-cinema-project/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                                   <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-0\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/select-japan/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"182\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cut-out-kikujiro-300x182.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cut-out-kikujiro-300x182.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cut-out-kikujiro-368x223.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cut-out-kikujiro-768x466.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cut-out-kikujiro-1024x621.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cut-out-kikujiro-1536x932.jpg 1536w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cut-out-kikujiro-2048x1242.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/select-japan/\">Select Japan</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Mon 14 Apr  &#8212;  Mon 23 Apr 2040\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Select Japan is an initiative from The Garden Cinema to showcase the best of Japanese cinema, classic and contemporary, with a focus on titles and filmmakers which have been rarely screened in the&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/select-japan/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                                   <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-0\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/bring-your-baby-screenings/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"208\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cut-out-babyfilm-1-300x208.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cut-out-babyfilm-1-300x208.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cut-out-babyfilm-1-368x256.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cut-out-babyfilm-1-768x533.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cut-out-babyfilm-1-1024x711.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/cut-out-babyfilm-1.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/bring-your-baby-screenings/\">Bring Your Baby Screenings</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Mon 24 Nov  &#8212;  Sun 01 Jan 2040\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">A chance for parents and carers with babies of twelve months and under to see the latest releases in a relaxed environment.  These screenings will have raised lighting, reduced volume levels, and captions/subtitles&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/bring-your-baby-screenings/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                                   <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-0\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/dear-italy/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cut-out-vitti-300x225.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cut-out-vitti-300x225.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cut-out-vitti-368x276.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cut-out-vitti-768x576.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cut-out-vitti-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cut-out-vitti.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/dear-italy/\">Dear Italy</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Fri 19 Sep  &#8212;  Mon 31 Dec 2040\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Dear Italy is The Garden Cinema’s love letter to Italian Cinema. We are delighted to showcase films not only widely considered classics but also the most beloved by audiences and critics alike. This&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/dear-italy/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                                                    <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season hidden-\"    >\n            <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__inner\">\n\n              <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/nobody-asked-for-this/\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image-block\">\n                                    <img width=\"265\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/NOBODYASKED-265x300.png\" class=\"films-list__by-season__season__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/NOBODYASKED-265x300.png 265w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/NOBODYASKED-368x417.png 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/NOBODYASKED-768x871.png 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/NOBODYASKED.png 891w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 265px) 100vw, 265px\" />                                </a>\n              <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__content-block\">\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__title\"><a\n                    href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/nobody-asked-for-this/\">Nobody Asked for This!</a></div>\n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__date\" style=\"display: none\">\n\n                    Thu 01 May  &#8212;  Mon 12 May 2025\n                </div>\n\n                  \n                <div class=\"films-list__by-season__season__description\">Video Bazaar presents “NOBODY ASKED FOR THIS!” A new strand in the Garden Cinema’s brand new Atrium bar celebrating cinema’s most unhinged visions and esoteric detritus. Step into a realm of the forgotten,&hellip;</div>\n                <a class=\"films-list__by-season__season__button\"\n                   href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/strand/nobody-asked-for-this/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"films-list__by-event films-list-block\">\n  <div class=\"films-list__by-event__inner\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__row\">\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/summertime-sadness-2026/\">\n            <img width=\"212\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/7-212x300.png\" class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/7-212x300.png 212w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/7-724x1024.png 724w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/7-768x1086.png 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/7-1086x1536.png 1086w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/7-368x521.png 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/7.png 1414w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 212px) 100vw, 212px\" /></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">FESTIVAL: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/summertime-sadness-2026/\">Summertime Sadness 2026</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\"> Sun 21 Jun\n              &#8212;  Tue 25 Aug 2026</div>\n        <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              Desire, despair, deep water Why cry in the sun when you can sulk in the pool? For the second year running,&hellip; </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/summertime-sadness-2026/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/member-mingle/\">\n                        <img class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/3929973.jpg\" /></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">EVENT: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/member-mingle/\">Members' Mingle</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\">Tue 25 Aug 2026</div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              Our regular Members' Mingle returns on Tuesday 25 August! Join us in the Atrium Bar from 19:00 onwards to meet fellow&hellip;\n\n              </div>\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/member-mingle/\">Read&nbsp;more</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/indy-film-library/\">\n                        <img class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5881573.png\" /></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">EVENT: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/indy-film-library/\">Indy Film Library presents: UK Short Film Showcase II</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\">Sat 29 Aug 2026</div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              Indy Film Library presents: UK Short Film Showcase II The screening will be preceded by an introduction from the filmmakers and&hellip;\n\n              </div>\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/indy-film-library/\">Read&nbsp;more</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/kino-london-short-film-festival-2026/\">\n            <img width=\"170\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/KLSFF-2026-Main-Poster-small-170x300.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/KLSFF-2026-Main-Poster-small-170x300.jpg 170w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/KLSFF-2026-Main-Poster-small-368x649.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/KLSFF-2026-Main-Poster-small.jpg 397w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 170px) 100vw, 170px\" /></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">FESTIVAL: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/kino-london-short-film-festival-2026/\">Kino London Short Film Festival 2026</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\"> Sun 30 Aug\n            </div>\n        <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              Kino Short Film connects emerging filmmakers with audiences who crave something outside the mainstream. From first time filmmakers to Oscar winners,&hellip; </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/kino-london-short-film-festival-2026/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-dream-songs-qa/\">\n                        <img class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5997639.jpg\" /></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">EVENT: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-dream-songs-qa/\">The Dream Songs + Q&amp;A</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\">Fri 04 Sep 2026</div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              The screening will be followed by an online Q&A with the director Cho Hyun-chul, moderated by Dr. Hyunseon Lee (Professorial Research Associate at SOAS), interpreted&hellip;\n\n              </div>\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-dream-songs-qa/\">Read&nbsp;more</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/live-folk-music-czech-drinks-the-cassandra-cat/\">\n                        <img class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5984646.jpg\" /></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">EVENT: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/live-folk-music-czech-drinks-the-cassandra-cat/\">Live folk music, Czech drinks + The Cassandra Cat</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\">Sat 05 Sep 2026</div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              To celebrate the start of our new season of Czechoslovak New Wave cinema, members are invited to join us on Saturday&hellip;\n\n              </div>\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/live-folk-music-czech-drinks-the-cassandra-cat/\">Read&nbsp;more</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/super-nature-qa/\">\n                        <img class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5955861.jpg\" /></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">EVENT: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/super-nature-qa/\">Super Nature + Q&amp;A</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\">Sun 06 Sep 2026</div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              The screening will be followed by a Q&A with the director Ed Sayers. Super Nature celebrates our universal connection to nature,&hellip;\n\n              </div>\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/super-nature-qa/\">Read&nbsp;more</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/focus-hong-kong-september-2026/\">\n            <img width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/focusHK_leadimage-SEPT26-notext-300x169.jpg\" class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/focusHK_leadimage-SEPT26-notext-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/focusHK_leadimage-SEPT26-notext-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/focusHK_leadimage-SEPT26-notext-768x432.jpg 768w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/focusHK_leadimage-SEPT26-notext-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/focusHK_leadimage-SEPT26-notext-368x207.jpg 368w, https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/focusHK_leadimage-SEPT26-notext.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">FESTIVAL: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/focus-hong-kong-september-2026/\">Focus Hong Kong September 2026</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\"> Sun 06 Sep\n            </div>\n        <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              Focus Hong Kong is a UK film festival dedicated to celebrating the amazing cinema and filmmakers of Hong Kong, from early&hellip; </div>\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/festival/focus-hong-kong-september-2026/\">Read&nbsp;more</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-liszt-institute-presents-silent-friend-qa/\">\n                        <img class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/5956311.jpg\" /></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">EVENT: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-liszt-institute-presents-silent-friend-qa/\">The Liszt Institute presents: Silent Friend + Q&amp;A</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\">Mon 07 Sep 2026</div>\n\n\n          <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__partner__link\">Screened in partnership with <a\n                  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/partner/liszt-institute-hungarian-cultural-centre-london/\">Liszt Institute, Hungarian Cultural Centre London</a> </span>        <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              Join the Liszt Institute for a very special screening of Ildikó Enyedi’s 2025 masterpiece, Silent Friend, followed by a live Q&A with the&hellip;\n\n              </div>\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/the-liszt-institute-presents-silent-friend-qa/\">Read&nbsp;more</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/sitesound-11-service-please/\">\n                        <img class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"h