ent__event__date\">Tue 29 Sep 2026</div>\n\n\n          <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__partner__link\">Screened in partnership with <a\n                  href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/partner/london-review-of-books/\">London Review of Books</a> </span>        <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              The penultimate film in the current season of LRB Screen, which explores visions of London created by non-British filmmakers, is the&hellip;\n\n              </div>\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__button\"><a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/lrb-london-reviewed-i-hired-a-contract-killer-1990-with-owen-hatherley/\">Read&nbsp;more</a></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event\">\n    <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image-block\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/members-scratch-night/\">\n                        <img class=\"films-list__by-event__event__image middle\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.savoysystems.co.uk/GCL/3866508.jpg\" /></a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__content-block\">\n        <span class=\"films-list__by-event__event__pre-title\">EVENT: </span>\n        <h2 class=\"films-list__by-event__event__title\"><a\n            href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/members-scratch-night/\">Members' Scratch Night</a></h2>\n        <div class=\"films-list__by-event__event__date\">Wed 30 Sep 2026</div>\n\n\n                  <div class=\"synopsis-wrapper\">\n\n          <div class=\"films-list__by-event__synopsis\">\n                                              After a brief summer break, our regular Members' Scratch Night returns on Wednesday 30 September to help more of the creatives in&hellip;\n\n          