            "text": "<!doctype html>\n<!--[if lt IE 7]><html lang=\"en-GB\" class=\"no-js lt-ie9 lt-ie8 lt-ie7\"><![endif]-->\n<!--[if (IE 7)&!(IEMobile)]><html lang=\"en-GB\" class=\"no-js lt-ie9 lt-ie8\"><![endif]-->\n<!--[if (IE 8)&!(IEMobile)]><html lang=\"en-GB\" class=\"no-js lt-ie9\"><![endif]-->\n<!--[if gt IE 8]><!--> <html lang=\"en-GB\" class=\"no-js\" bgcolor=\"#1f1f1f\"><!--<![endif]-->\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n        <meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"True\">\n    <meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"320\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\"/>\n    \n    \n    \n    <title>London Latino Film Festival presents: Querido trópico (Beloved Tropic) / The Garden Cinema</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Querido Tr&#243;pico&nbsp;is a drama by Ana Endara that explores the unexpected connection between two women from different backgrounds brought together by circumstance. Set in Panama, the film unfolds through an intimate portrait of loneliness, care, and human vulnerability, revealing the invisible bonds that emerge between people searching for belonging. With&hellip;\">\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/london-latino-film-festival-presents-querido-tropico-beloved-tropic/\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.thegardencinema.co.uk/film/london-latino-film-festival-presents-querido-tropico-beloved-tropic/\">\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"The Garden Cinema\">\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\">\n<meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/p/The-Garden-Cinema-100037345105930/?locale=en_GB\">\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https: